fix: resolve Persona Folio mock entries and Omnicortex save failures

FolioContext - auth timing bug:
- Replaced sync auth.currentUser check (always null on mount due to async Firebase Auth init)
  with onAuthStateChanged listener so Firestore persona roster correctly attaches after auth resolves
- Added onAuthStateChanged import from firebase/auth

useFirestoreSync - silent write failures:
- Imported auth from firebase
- Gated saveEntry, deleteEntry, and importJSON on auth.currentUser presence
- Now returns false with a clear console warning when user is not authenticated instead of
  silently hitting Firestore permission errors

firestore.rules - DBM access:
- Changed DBM reference collections (/{collection}/{document=**}) to allow public reads (allow read: if true)
  so unauthenticated users can browse Omnicortex reference data
- Writes still require authentication
- User-private personas and Story Foundry universe data remain auth-gated for both read and write
